gering Stellar Swirl.","stats":"ATK% · ATK%/Anemo DMG% · CR/CD"},{"names":["Viridescent Venerer"],"text":"Boosts regular Swirl and shreds the Swirled element’s RES; lower direct Stellar Swirl damage than Scarlet Proof.","stats":""},{"names":["Gladiator's Finale","A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"text":"Combines 36% ATK from both 2-piece bonuses, providing a strong placeholder build while farming Scarlet Proof.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Category Five","members":["Vesna","Odette","Vodyanitsa","Faruzan"],"text":"Vesna deals Stellar Swirl damage while Odette supplies Cryo and reaction support. Vodyanitsa heals and buffs, and Faruzan strengthens Anemo damage.","roles":["On-field DPS","Cryo Enabler / Buffer","Healer / Buffer","Anemo Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Celestial Spending","members":["Vesna","Odette","Vodyanitsa","Nicole"],"text":"Odette enables Stellar Swirl and adds Cryo support. Vodyanitsa heals and buffs, while Nicole protects and strengthens Vesna’s damage.","roles":["On-field DPS","Cryo Enabler / Buffer","Healer / Buffer","Shielder / Buffer"]},{"name":"WEATHER ADVISORY","members":["Vesna","Furina","Vodyanitsa","Faruzan"],"text":"Furina buffs damage and applies Hydro, Vodyanitsa heals and shreds RES, and Faruzan boosts Anemo damage and shreds Anemo RES.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Buffer","Anemo Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"TEMU TORNADO","members":["Vesna","Traveler (Cryo)","Xingqiu","Sucrose"],"text":"Cryo Traveler enables Stellar Swirl. Xingqiu adds Hydro through Normal Attack triggers, while Sucrose offers grouping and Elemental Mastery support.","roles":["On-field DPS","Cryo Enabler / Sub DPS","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","On-field Driver / EM Buffer"]}],"v":"Stellar Swirl Carry: Use Scarlet Proof for Vesna’s Stellar Swirl-focused damage.\nVV Team Utility: Trade Vesna’s personal output for Viridescent Venerer support.","n":2},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Vesna is an Anemo DPS who excels in stellar-swirl teams with powerful skill based damage. She rewards frequent reactions and strong off-field teammates.","pros":["High damage","Strong Stellar-Swirl","Powerful Skill","Smooth rotations"],"cons":["Team restrictive","Support dependent","Wants premium supports","Setup dependent"],"weapons":["Beyond the Chrysalis","Whitelake Frostfeather","Azurelight","Absolution","New Bough","Heretic's Molten Blade","Emberwell","The Black Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Scarlet Proof"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale","A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":"Main DPS"}],"main":["ATK%","ATK% / Anemo DMG%","Crit Rate / Crit DMG"],"stats":["ATK: 2,000-2,500+","Crit Rate: 50% - 60%","Crit DMG: 180%+","Energy Recharge: 110% - 130%"],"vars":[{"title":"Stellar Swirl Carry","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Beyond the Chrysalis","Whitelake Frostfeather","Absolution"],"arts":[{"sets":["Scarlet Proof"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Balance CRIT and damage stats for Stellar Swirl.","teams":"Cryo and Electro reaction setup plus relevant buffs.","when":"Use Scarlet Proof for Vesna’s Stellar Swirl-focused damage.","cond":"Needs correct reaction support.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"VV Team Utility","role":"Anemo Support","weapons":["Whitelake Frostfeather","New Bough"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"EM/ER can be useful for Swirl utility; balance personal damage loss.","teams":"Teammates benefiting from Pyro, Hydro, Electro or Cryo RES shred.","when":"Trade Vesna’s personal output for Viridescent Venerer support.","cond":"VV does not shred Anemo RES.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Vayuda Turquoise Sliver","Vayuda Turquoise Fragment","Vayuda Turquoise Chunk","Vayuda Turquoise Gemstone","Vagabond's Cracked Armor","Teachings of Glory","Guide to Glory","Philosophies of Glory","Ethereal Glimmershard","Ethereal Crystal","Ethereal Crystalscale Stone","Golden Fern","Profaned Sprout","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Category Five","members":["Vesna","Odette","Vodyanitsa","Faruzan"]},{"name":"Celestial Spending","members":["Vesna","Odette","Vodyanitsa","Nicole"]},{"name":"WEATHER ADVISORY","members":["Vesna","Furina","Vodyanitsa","Faruzan"]},{"name":"TEMU TORNADO","members":["Vesna","Traveler (Cryo)","Xingqiu","Sucrose"]}]}}],"title":"Vesna","el":"Anemo"}